    "text": "Volume of parallelopiped <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />sign conversion for <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <img src=\"assets\\st0186_7f2b5946ba28.jpeg\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 120px;\" /><br />at <math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> changes its sign from <math><mo>-</mo></math> ve to <math><mo>+</mo></math> ve<